            "description": "Creating a new Sale\n======================\n\nThis method allows create a new sale.\n\nImportant Informations\n-----------------------\n\nBefore create a sale read this section to know how to get needed informations.\n\nQuery Methods\n--------------\n\nBelow are described which endpoits should be used to compose the New Sale request\n\n* **IdCasal** : *Aproach Control* => Getting leads by period\n* **IdCasalGerenteSala** : *Aproach Control* => Getting leads by period\n* **IdOrigemVenda** : *Lookups* => Getting sales resource\n* **IdTipoRelacionamento** : *Lookups* => Getting relationship types\n* **IdComprador1 / IdComprador2** : \n1. *General Registers* => Getting person by ID - All informations\n2. *General Registers* => Getting person by CPF - Minimal informations\n* **IdProduto** : *Lookups* => Getting products\n* **IdCotaUh** : *Lookups* => Getting quotas by product\n* **ValorNegociado** : \n1. **Products of type Points** - *Lookups* => Getting Quotas by Product, property ValorUnitario\n2. **Products of type Quota** - *Lookups* => Getting Products, property ValorFinanciado\n* **IdMeioPagamento** : *Lookups* => Getting payment types\n* **IdTipoOrigemContaFinanceira** : *Lookups* => Getting installments types\n* **IdIndexador** : *Lookups* => Getting monetary indexeres"
          },
